2025-11-01 09:46:23,854 - blueprints.imaging - INFO - DALL-E landscape API request: {'model': 'dall-e-3', 'prompt': "A young girl stands before an ancient Celtic doorway, adorned with intricate symbols of protection and welcome, in a misty Highland glade, circa 10th century Scotland. She reaches out her hands to receive offerings from a companion holding a wooden bowl of steaming food and drink amidst the veil between worlds. The background shrouds the rolling hills and ancient standing stones, hinting at the mystical realm beyond. Soft, feathery brushstrokes fade towards the edges as the glowing embers of the threshold moment emanate from within the doorway, casting an ethereal light on the girl's face and attire. Ochre, sienna, and umber earth tones blend with celestial blues and golden hues in a watercolour wash, evoking the dreamlike quality of a misty dawn. The pen and ink lines dance across the paper, weaving in and out of the brushstrokes, as if tracing the ancient Celtic knotwork that adorns the doorway's frame. The image dissolves gradually to white at the edges, as if the boundaries between reality and the mystical realm are indistinct. The atmosphere is one of reverent meditation, inviting the viewer to step across the threshold into a world of ancient mysticism.", 'n': 1, 'size': '1792x1024', 'quality': 'high', 'style': 'natural'}
