2025-11-01 09:46:57,436 - blueprints.imaging - INFO - DALL-E portrait API request: {'model': 'dall-e-3', 'prompt': "A solemn moonlit scene of a Celtic elder standing alone amidst a ring of flickering candles and the faint glow of a dying bonfire in a mist-shrouded ancient forest glade during the Iron Age, circa 500 BCE. The air is heavy with anticipation as ancestral figures watch over from the shadows, their presence hinted at by wisps of smoke curling towards the treetops. Soft brushstrokes blending towards the edges evoke a dreamlike quality, while the muted ochres, siennas, and umbers dominate the color palette, punctuated by celestial blues and golds that seem to emanate from the fading light. The druidic robes draped over the elder's shoulders appear worn and weathered, with intricate pen & ink patterns suggesting ancient rituals and mystical knowledge. As the last embers of the bonfire die out, the flickering flames cast an otherworldly glow on the surrounding trees, imbuing the scene with a contemplative, mystical atmosphere.", 'n': 1, 'size': '1024x1792', 'quality': 'high', 'style': 'natural'}
